{"text":"正始二年四月十五日，像主齋師、蕩寇將軍、殿中將軍、領鈎楯令王史平、吳共，合曹人與願，爲今王上造彌勒像一區。橫野將軍、鈎楯署洪池丞權六煩。","tags":[{"name":"Office","term":"蕩寇將軍","refId":null,"text":"蕩寇將軍","start":15,"end":19},{"name":"Office","term":"殿中將軍","refId":null,"text":"殿中將軍","start":20,"end":24},{"name":"Office","term":"鈎楯令","refId":null,"text":"鈎楯令","start":26,"end":29},{"name":"PersonName","term":"王史平","refId":null,"text":"王史平","start":29,"end":32},{"name":"PersonName","term":"吳共","refId":null,"text":"吳共","start":33,"end":35},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":47,"end":49},{"name":"Office","term":"橫野將軍","refId":null,"text":"橫野將軍","start":53,"end":57},{"name":"Office","term":"洪池丞","refId":null,"text":"洪池丞","start":61,"end":64}]}